      "step_number": 1,
      "text": "Step 1: Calculate the vectors $\\overrightarrow{OA}$ and $\\overrightarrow{OB}$ given as $\\overrightarrow{OA} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 3 \\end{pmatrix}$ and $\\overrightarrow{OB} = \\begin{pmatrix} -3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$.",
