      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 4,
      "text": "Step 4: Find the magnitude of the cross product vector $\\overrightarrow{OA} \\times \\overrightarrow{AB}$:\n\\[\n\\|\\overrightarrow{OA} \\times \\overrightarrow{AB}\\| = \\sqrt{8^2 + (-10)^2 + 4^2} = \\sqrt{64 + 100 + 16} = \\sqrt{180} = 6\\sqrt{5}\n\\]",
      "z": 0.18435665317507377
